l%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A12%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1692207400490\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/08/04/282941837/198096c9be5070ca8ba0409c3114386c_891274745996693124.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">309</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">9</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">裁一颗星星，挂在在孤独的梦里。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">小小的魔法少女拿起剪刀，将缠绕不清的思绪剪断。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">「剪切，是为了守护住仅有的此刻。」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"> 切割梦魇的白刃</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定。点燃伤害造成的全伤害提高20.0％。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">非奇迹☆魔法少女装备时，武器技攻击命中敌人后产生法阵下压，对范围内敌人造成100.0％攻击力*目标点燃层数的点燃伤害。奇迹☆魔法少女装备时，释放【裁断】时引爆敌人标记后额外产生一次爆炸，对敌人造成100.0％攻击力*目标点燃层数的点燃伤害，释放【裁断】时额外获得3层【魔法少女时间】。释放【拼合】时额外产生四根针，造成140.0％攻击力*目标点燃层数的点燃伤害。上述伤害皆最低计算1层点燃层数，最多计算5层，且触发间隔15秒。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">晚星闪烁的辉耀</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">必杀技及爆发状态攻击造成的火焰元素伤害提高20.0％。必杀技及爆发状态攻击命中敌人时，被命中敌人中点燃层数最高的目标身上每有一层点燃效果，回复自身1.5点能量，最多计算5层，触发间隔15秒</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"a\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-t