/p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/08/16/282941837/404c29fa10b3ce7cea2d69e743263435_465095806017327969.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">火伤特性的点燃特化输出向环刃武器。提供常驻的点燃特化全伤和攻击点燃状态下敌人时的回能。奇迹☆魔法少女装备时，释放【裁断】和【拼合】时皆可触发基于点燃层数的倍率攻击；释放【裁断】时会提供三层【魔法少女时间】以提高点燃的最大叠加层数，提高了角色对加成的利用率，配合其提供的增伤和回能，全方面的增强了角色的作战能力。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/08/16/282941837/404c29fa10b3ce7cea2d69e743263435_465095806017327969.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
